# Track development documentation, tests and archived reference templates.
# Generated reports, renderings, caches and local experiments stay local.
dev/*
!dev/README.md
!dev/tests/
dev/tests/*
!dev/tests/test_*.py
!dev/scripts/
dev/scripts/*
!dev/scripts/validate_project.py
!dev/scripts/smoke_test.py
!dev/ci/
dev/ci/*
!dev/ci/pyproject.toml
!dev/ci/requirements-dev.txt
!dev/docs/
!dev/docs/**
!dev/templates/
!dev/templates/**
!dev/reports/
!dev/reports/**
